no leak, no kink, the swivel turns","must":false},{"k":"cartridge-opens-and-closes-by-hand-20-ti","label":"Cartridge: opens and closes by hand 20 times; still opens after a week of daily use, flow down less than 20%","must":false},{"k":"chlorine-us-water-only-free-chlorine-bef","label":"Chlorine (US water only): free chlorine before and after at 40 C, read within a minute: 80% less or better","must":false},{"k":"box-and-labels-undamaged-no-other-brand","label":"Box and labels: undamaged, no other brand, room for your GPSR details, a not-for-electric-showers warning","must":false},{"k":"delivery-timed-order-to-doorstep-days-ma","label":"Delivery timed: order to doorstep days match the quote","must":false}],"questions":[{"en":"Are you the factory? Please send your business licence and a video of the production line today, with my name on paper.","zh":"您是工厂吗？请发营业执照，以及今天生产线的视频（纸上写我的名字）。"},{"en":"What exactly is in the filter cartridge: grams of KDF-55, calcium sulfite and activated carbon (and any ceramic balls)? Please send a photo of a cartridge cut open.","zh":"滤芯里具体有什么：KDF-55、亚硫酸钙和活性炭各多少克（有没有陶瓷球）？请发一张剖开滤芯的照片。"},{"en":"Flow rate at 3 bar in litres per minute, with and without the flow restrictor? Do you have a 1.8 gpm (6.8 L/min) version for the US?","zh":"3巴（0.3MPa）水压下的流量是每分钟多少升？有无限流片分别是多少？有没有美国用的1.8 GPM（6.8升/分钟）版本？"},{"en":"Materials: virgin ABS? The hose''s inner tube EPDM or PVC, phthalate-free? Brass or plastic fittings, and the lead content? Thread G1/2?","zh":"材料：是否全新ABS料？软管内管是EPDM还是PVC，是否不含邻苯？接头是铜还是塑料，含铅量多少？螺纹是G1/2吗？"},{"en":"Test reports: REACH (SVHC, phthalates) for the hose and plastics, and any flow-rate or NSF/ANSI 177 report: the report number, the lab, and the applicant''s name (must be your company).","zh":"检测报告：软管和塑料件的REACH（SVHC、邻苯）报告，以及流量或NSF/ANSI 177报告：报告编号、实验室和申请人名称（必须是贵公司）。"},{"en":"Replacement cartridges: price at 100, 1,000 and 5,000; exact size (length and diameter in mm, the same in every batch); can you supply them for at least 12 months?","zh":"替换滤芯：100、1000、5000个的单价；准确尺寸（长度和直径，毫米，每批一致）；能否保证至少12个月持续供货？"},{"en":"Price per complete set at 50, 200 and 1,000 units; with my logo on the head and the box: MOQ and cost?","zh":"整套价格：50、200、1000套分别多少？在花洒和彩盒上印我的logo：起订量和费用？"},{"en":"Lead time from payment to dispatch for samples, 200 sets and 1,000 sets?","zh":"从付款到发货：样品、200套、1000套分别需要多久？"},{"en":"Can you ship single orders to customers in the Netherlands and Germany (and the US)? Which line, how many days door to door, and are EU duty and fees included (DDP/IOSS)?","zh":"能否一件代发到荷兰和德国（以及美国）的客户？用什么物流线路、门到门几天、是否包含欧盟关税和费用（DDP/IOSS）？"},{"en":"Your defect rate, and do you replace or refund units that leak or crack, free of charge? In writing, please.","zh":"不良率是多少？漏水或开裂的产品是否免费补发或退款？请书面确认。"},{"en":"Packed weight and size of one set, sets per carton, carton size and weight?","zh":"单套包装重量和尺寸、每箱套数、外箱尺寸和重量？"}]}', '{}', '{}', '{}', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z'
